{"title":"Pluralbildung: Nomen mit Zischlauten","puid":"c-eng-5/54tgor","path":"/../c-eng-5/topic-01-first-days-school/block-08-plurals/level-02","type":"normal","voiceLang":"en","voice":"f3","keyboardLayout":"standardENG","lsg":{"width":250},"image":{"width":200},"trainers":[{"trainer":"buttons","instruction":{"text":"Tippe die <b>Pluralform</b> des Nomens an.","speaker":true,"voiceLang":"de","voice":"f5"},"shuffleButtons":true,"shuffleAtoms":true,"soundMode":"b","image":"adobe_95706626","atoms":{"b":"++sandwiches sandwich"}},{"trainer":"content","soundMode":"b","hint":{"text":"Ein Zischlaut ist an seinem deutlich hörbaren Zischen erkennbar, wie zum Beispiel in <i>bu<m-yellow>s</m-yellow></i>, <i>ro<m-yellow>se</m-yellow></i>, <i>bo<m-yellow>x</m-yellow></i> und <i>ben<m-yellow>ch</m-yellow></i>.","sound":"Ein Zischlaut ist an seinem deutlich hörbaren Zischen erkennbar, wie zum Beispiel in <voice voiceLang='en' voice='m2'>bus</voice><break/> <voice voiceLang='en' voice='m2'>rose</voice><break/> <voice voiceLang='en' voice='m2'>box</voice> und <voice voiceLang='en' voice='m2'>bench</voice><break/>","voiceLang":"de","voice":"m3","style":"avatar"},"atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-5/topic-01-first-days-school/block-08-plurals/lsg/lv2-irregular-sx.lsg"},{"title":"Pluralbildung nach Zischlauten"},{"text":"Wenn ein Nomen mit einem <b>Zischlaut</b> endet, fügst du für den Plural <b>-&#65279;es</b> hinzu.","sound":"Wenn ein Nomen mit einem Zischlaut endet, fügst du für den Plural <b>e s</b> hinzu.","voiceLang":"de","voice":"m3"},{"button":"Beispiele"},{"text":"Lies die Beispiele laut vor. Höre sie dir anschließend an, indem du auf den Lautsprecher tippst.","speaker":true,"voiceLang":"de","voice":"m3"},{"example":{"a":"one bus → two bus<m-yellow>es</m-yellow>","sound":"one bus, two buses"}},{"example":{"a":"one box → two box<m-yellow>es</m-yellow>","sound":"one box, two boxes"}},{"example":{"a":"one bench → two bench<m-yellow>es</m-yellow>","sound":"one bench, two benches"}},{"but